			<div class="content" id="post-content-2317519">
									

<p>Noting here that I've updated on the SCP. To be specific, I've changed Addendum 2144-1 into something more subtle and does not cry out &quot;Schrodinger's Cat&quot; directly (since I suspect everyone would have figured it out on their own. If not, my Authorial posts have spoiled it.).</p>
<p>Furthermore, I do think that the dream diaries might have been a bit too &quot;convenient&quot;. The content of the dream diaries still stands, although they are never recorded and only Schmidt and Mel know about it.</p>
<p>I have brought back the collar from the original article, although it is just a normal collar now.</p>
<p>EDIT: And I have also shamelessly put in one of my author avatars into this SCP to introduce her in the meta-narrative of Foundation-verse. It makes sense in-context, since An's job is a containment advisor.</p>

